#: check.c:583
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Performing Consistency Checks on Old Live Server\n"
"------------------------------------------------"
msgstr "在執行中的舊伺服器上執行一致性檢查\n------------------------------------------------"

#: check.c:589
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Performing Consistency Checks\n"
"-----------------------------"
msgstr ""
"執行一致性檢查\n"
"-----------------------------"

#: check.c:790
#, c-format
msgid "Swap mode can only upgrade clusters from PostgreSQL version %s and later."
msgstr "交換模式只能升級 PostgreSQL %s 及更高版本的叢集。"

#: check.c:813
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"*Clusters are compatible*"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"*叢集相容*"

#: check.c:821
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"If pg_upgrade fails after this point, you must re-initdb the\n"
"new cluster before continuing."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"如果 pg_upgrade 在這個階段後失敗，您必須執行 initdb 再次\n"
"建立新叢集才能繼續。"

#: check.c:862
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Some statistics are not transferred by pg_upgrade.\n"
"Once you start the new server, consider running these two commands:\n"
"    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-in-stages --missing-stats-only\n"
"    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-only"
msgstr "pg_upgrade 不會轉移部分統計資料。\n啟動新伺服器後，請考慮執行以下兩個命令:\n    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-in-stages --missing-stats-only\n    %s/vacuumdb %s--all --analyze-only"

#: check.c:871
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Running this script will delete the old cluster's data files:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"執行此腳本將刪除舊叢集的資料檔:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:876
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Could not create a script to delete the old cluster's data files\n"
"because user-defined tablespaces or the new cluster's data directory\n"
"exist in the old cluster directory.  The old cluster's contents must\n"
"be deleted manually."
msgstr "無法建立用來刪除舊叢集資料檔的腳本，\n因為在舊叢集目錄中存在使用者定義的表空間或新叢集的資料目錄。\n必須手動刪除舊叢集的內容。"

#: check.c:888
#, c-format
msgid "Checking cluster versions"
msgstr "檢查叢集版本"

#: check.c:900
#, c-format
msgid "This utility can only upgrade from PostgreSQL version %s and later."
msgstr "本工具只能從 PostgreSQL 版本 %s 及更新的版本升級。"

#: check.c:905
#, c-format
msgid "This utility can only upgrade to PostgreSQL version %s."
msgstr "本工具只能升級至 PostgreSQL 版本 %s。"

#: check.c:914
#, c-format
msgid "This utility cannot be used to downgrade to older major PostgreSQL versions."
msgstr "本工具不能用於降級至較舊的 PostgreSQL 主要版本。"

#: check.c:919
#, c-format
msgid "Old cluster data and binary directories are from different major versions."
msgstr "舊叢集的資料和執行檔目錄來自不同的主要版本。"

#: check.c:922
#, c-format
msgid "New cluster data and binary directories are from different major versions."
msgstr "新叢集的資料和執行檔目錄來自不同的主要版本。"

#: check.c:933
#, c-format
msgid "The option %s cannot be used for upgrades from PostgreSQL %s and later."
msgstr "從 PostgreSQL %2$s 及更高版本升級時不能使用選項 %1$s。"

#: check.c:949
#, c-format
msgid "When checking a live server, the old and new port numbers must be different."
msgstr "檢查執行中的伺服器時，新舊連接埠必須不同。"

#: check.c:969
#, c-format
msgid "New cluster database \"%s\" is not empty: found relation \"%s.%s\""
msgstr "新叢集資料庫 \"%s\" 不是空的: 找到關聯 \"%s.%s\""

#: check.c:992
#, c-format
msgid "Checking new cluster tablespace directories"
msgstr "正在檢查新叢集的表空間目錄"

#: check.c:1003
#, c-format
msgid "new cluster tablespace directory already exists: \"%s\""
msgstr "新叢集的表空間目錄已存在: \"%s\""

#: check.c:1037
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"WARNING:  new data directory should not be inside the old data directory, i.e. %s"
msgstr "\n警告:  新的資料目錄不宜位於舊的資料目錄內，即 %s"

#: check.c:1061
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"WARNING:  user-defined tablespace locations should not be inside the data directory, i.e. %s"
msgstr "\n警告:  使用者定義的表空間位置不宜位於資料目錄內，即 %s"

#: check.c:1071
#, c-format
msgid "Creating script to delete old cluster"
msgstr "建立刪除舊叢集的腳本"

#: check.c:1099
#, c-format
msgid "could not add execute permission to file \"%s\": %m"
msgstr "無法將執行權限加到檔案 \"%s\": %m"

#: check.c:1119
#, c-format
msgid "Checking database user is the install user"
msgstr "檢查資料庫使用者是否為安裝使用者"

#: check.c:1135
#, c-format
msgid "database user \"%s\" is not the install user"
msgstr "資料庫使用者 \"%s\" 不是安裝使用者"

#: check.c:1146
#, c-format
msgid "could not determine the number of users"
msgstr "無法確定使用者數量"

#: check.c:1154
#, c-format
msgid "Only the install user can be defined in the new cluster."
msgstr "新叢集中只能定義安裝使用者。"

#: check.c:1184
#, c-format
msgid "Checking database connection settings"
msgstr "檢查資料庫連線設定"

#: check.c:1212
#, c-format
msgid "template0 must not allow connections, i.e. its pg_database.datallowconn must be false"
msgstr "template0 不允許連線，即其 pg_database.datallowconn 必須為 false"

#: check.c:1239 check.c:1300 check.c:1415 check.c:1508 check.c:1633
#: check.c:1707 check.c:1790 check.c:1865 check.c:1923 check.c:2003
#: check.c:2355 check.c:2511 check.c:2651 check.c:2720 function.c:235
#, c-format
msgid "fatal"
msgstr "致命錯誤"

#: check.c:1240
#, c-format
msgid ""
"All non-template0 databases must allow connections, i.e. their\n"
"pg_database.datallowconn must be true and pg_database.datconnlimit\n"
"must not be -2.  Your installation contains non-template0 databases\n"
"which cannot be connected to.  Consider allowing connection for all\n"
"non-template0 databases or drop the databases which do not allow\n"
"connections.  A list of databases with the problem is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "所有非 template0 的資料庫必須允許連線，即它們的\npg_database.datallowconn 必須為 true，且 pg_database.datconnlimit\n不得為 -2。您的安裝中包含了不能連線的\n非 template0 資料庫。請考慮允許所有非 template0 資料庫的連線，\n或刪除不允許連線的資料庫。有問題的資料庫列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1267
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for unsupported encodings"
msgstr "正在檢查不支援的編碼"

#: check.c:1301
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains databases using encodings that are\n"
"no longer supported.  Consider dumping and restoring with UTF8.\n"
"A list of databases with unsupported encodings is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝中有資料庫使用已不再支援的編碼。\n可以考慮備份後以 UTF8 還原。\n使用不支援編碼的資料庫列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1323
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for prepared transactions"
msgstr "檢查已預備的交易"

#: check.c:1332
#, c-format
msgid "The source cluster contains prepared transactions"
msgstr "來源叢集包含已預備的交易"

#: check.c:1334
#, c-format
msgid "The target cluster contains prepared transactions"
msgstr "目標叢集包含已預備的交易"

#: check.c:1391
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for contrib/isn with bigint-passing mismatch"
msgstr "檢查 contrib/isn 傳遞 bigint 方式不一致"

#: check.c:1416
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains \"contrib/isn\" functions which rely on the\n"
"bigint data type.  Your old and new clusters pass bigint values\n"
"differently so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can\n"
"manually dump databases in the old cluster that use \"contrib/isn\"\n"
"facilities, drop them, perform the upgrade, and then restore them.  A\n"
"list of the problem functions is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含依賴於 bigint 資料型別的 \"contrib/isn\" 函式。由於您的\n新、舊叢集以不同方式傳遞 bigint 值，因此目前不能升級此叢集。您\n可以手動備份並刪除舊叢集中使用 \"contrib/isn\" 功能的資料庫，進行\n升級，然後還原它們。問題函式的清單位於以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1493
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for user-defined postfix operators"
msgstr "檢查使用者定義的後綴運算子"

#: check.c:1509
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains user-defined postfix operators, which are not\n"
"supported anymore.  Consider dropping the postfix operators and replacing\n"
"them with prefix operators or function calls.\n"
"A list of user-defined postfix operators is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安裝包含不再支援的使用者定義後綴運算子，請考慮刪除後綴運算子\n"
"並替換為前綴運算子或函式呼叫。\n"
"使用者定義後綴運算子的清單位於以下檔案中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1561
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for incompatible polymorphic functions"
msgstr "檢查不相容的多型函式"

#: check.c:1634
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains user-defined objects that refer to internal\n"
"polymorphic functions with arguments of type \"anyarray\" or \"anyelement\".\n"
"These user-defined objects must be dropped before upgrading and restored\n"
"afterwards, changing them to refer to the new corresponding functions with\n"
"arguments of type \"anycompatiblearray\" and \"anycompatible\".\n"
"A list of the problematic objects is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含參考內部多型函式的使用者定義物件，\n這些函式的引數型別為 \"anyarray\" 或 \"anyelement\"。\n這些使用者定義物件必須在升級之前刪除，升級之後再還原，\n並將它們改為參考新的對應函式，其引數型別為\n\"anycompatiblearray\" 和 \"anycompatible\"。\n問題物件的清單位於以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1692
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for tables WITH OIDS"
msgstr "檢查使用 WITH OIDS 的資料表"

#: check.c:1708
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains tables declared WITH OIDS, which is not\n"
"supported anymore.  Consider removing the oid column using\n"
"    ALTER TABLE ... SET WITHOUT OIDS;\n"
"A list of tables with the problem is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr ""
"您的安裝包含宣告 WITH OIDS 的資料表，但這已不再受支援。請考慮\n"
"使用以下方法移除 oid 欄位\n"
"    ALTER TABLE ... SET WITHOUT OIDS;\n"
"問題資料表的清單位於以下檔案中:\n"
"    %s"

#: check.c:1764
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for not-null constraint inconsistencies"
msgstr "正在檢查非空條件約束的不一致"

#: check.c:1791
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains inconsistent NOT NULL constraints.\n"
"If the parent column(s) are NOT NULL, then the child column must\n"
"also be marked NOT NULL, or the upgrade will fail.\n"
"You can fix this by running\n"
"    ALTER TABLE tablename ALTER column SET NOT NULL;\n"
"on each column listed in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝中存在不一致的 NOT NULL 條件約束。\n如果父資料表的欄位為 NOT NULL，子資料表的對應欄位\n也必須標記為 NOT NULL，否則升級將失敗。\n可以執行以下命令來修復:\n    ALTER TABLE tablename ALTER column SET NOT NULL;\n對以下檔案中列出的每一個欄位都執行此操作:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1850
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for uses of gist_inet_ops/gist_cidr_ops"
msgstr "正在檢查 gist_inet_ops/gist_cidr_ops 的使用情況"

#: check.c:1866
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains indexes that use the btree_gist extension's\n"
"gist_inet_ops or gist_cidr_ops operator classes, which cannot be\n"
"binary-upgraded.  Replace them with indexes that use the built-in GiST\n"
"inet_ops operator class.\n"
"A list of indexes with the problem is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含使用 btree_gist 擴充模組的 gist_inet_ops\n或 gist_cidr_ops 運算子類別的索引，這些索引不能進行\n二進位升級。請改用內建 GiST inet_ops 運算子類別\n的索引取代它們。\n有問題的索引列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1893
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for roles starting with \"pg_\""
msgstr "檢查以 \"pg_\" 開頭的角色"

#: check.c:1924
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains roles starting with \"pg_\".\n"
"\"pg_\" is a reserved prefix for system roles.  The cluster\n"
"cannot be upgraded until these roles are renamed.\n"
"A list of roles starting with \"pg_\" is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含以 \"pg_\" 開頭的角色，\"pg_\" 是系統角色的\n保留字首，在這些角色被重新命名之前，不能升級此叢集。\n以 \"pg_\" 開頭的角色列表位於以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:1975
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for user-defined encoding conversions"
msgstr "檢查使用者自訂的編碼轉換"

#: check.c:2004
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains user-defined encoding conversions.\n"
"The conversion function parameters changed in PostgreSQL version 14\n"
"so this cluster cannot currently be upgraded.  You can remove the\n"
"encoding conversions in the old cluster and restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of user-defined encoding conversions is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含了使用者自定義的編碼轉換，由於轉換函式的參數在\nPostgreSQL 版本 14 中有所更改，因此目前不能升級此叢集。您可以\n移除舊叢集中的編碼轉換，然後重新進行升級。\n使用者自定義的編碼轉換列表位於以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:2089
#, c-format
msgid "Checking for objects affected by Unicode update"
msgstr "正在檢查受 Unicode 更新影響的物件"

#: check.c:2188 version.c:139
#, c-format
msgid "warning"
msgstr "警告"

#: check.c:2189
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains relations that might be affected by a new version of Unicode.\n"
"A list of potentially-affected relations is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含可能受新版 Unicode 影響的關聯。\n可能受影響的關聯列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:2240
#, c-format
msgid "Checking new cluster replication slots"
msgstr "正在檢查新叢集的複寫槽"

# storage/smgr/md.c:367
#: check.c:2252
#, c-format
msgid "could not count the number of replication slots"
msgstr "無法統計複寫槽數量"

#: check.c:2262
#, c-format
msgid "expected 0 logical replication slots but found %d"
msgstr "預期為 0 個邏輯複寫槽，實際為 %d 個"

# commands/conversioncmds.c:151
#: check.c:2271
#, c-format
msgid "replication slot \"%s\" already exists in the new cluster"
msgstr "新叢集中已存在複寫槽 \"%s\""

#: check.c:2281 check.c:2418
#, c-format
msgid "could not determine parameter settings on new cluster"
msgstr "無法確定新叢集的參數設定"

#: check.c:2287
#, c-format
msgid "\"wal_level\" must be \"replica\" or \"logical\" but is set to \"%s\""
msgstr "\"wal_level\" 必須為 \"replica\" 或 \"logical\"，但目前設為 \"%s\""

#: check.c:2309
#, c-format
msgid "could not parse \"output_plugin_libraries\" setting '%s'"
msgstr "無法解析 \"output_plugin_libraries\" 設定 '%s'"

#: check.c:2356
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains logical replication slots with plugins\n"
"that are not allowed by the new cluster's output_plugin_libraries\n"
"setting. You can add trusted plugins to output_plugin_libraries\n"
"and/or remove affected slots, and then restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problematic slots is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含邏輯複寫槽，但其外掛程式\n為新叢集的 output_plugin_libraries 設定所不允許。\n可以將受信任的外掛程式加入 output_plugin_libraries，\n和/或刪除受影響的槽，然後重新開始升級。\n有問題的槽列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:2372
#, c-format
msgid "\"max_replication_slots\" (%d) must be greater than or equal to the number of logical replication slots in the old cluster plus one additional slot required for retaining conflict detection information (%d)"
msgstr "\"max_replication_slots\" (%d) 必須大於等於舊叢集的邏輯複寫槽數量與保留衝突偵測資訊所需的一個額外槽的總和 (%d)"

#: check.c:2378
#, c-format
msgid "\"max_replication_slots\" (%d) must be greater than or equal to the number of logical replication slots (%d) in the old cluster"
msgstr "\"max_replication_slots\" (%d) 必須大於等於舊叢集中的邏輯複寫槽數量 (%d)"

#: check.c:2410
#, c-format
msgid "Checking new cluster configuration for subscriptions"
msgstr "正在檢查新叢集的訂閱組態"

#: check.c:2422
#, c-format
msgid "\"max_active_replication_origins\" (%d) must be greater than or equal to the number of subscriptions (%d) in the old cluster"
msgstr "\"max_active_replication_origins\" (%d) 必須大於等於舊叢集中的訂閱數量 (%d)"

#: check.c:2444
#, c-format
msgid "Checking logical replication slots"
msgstr "正在檢查邏輯複寫槽"

#: check.c:2512
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains logical replication slots that cannot be upgraded.\n"
"You can remove invalid slots and/or consume the pending WAL for other slots,\n"
"and then restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problematic slots is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含不能升級的邏輯複寫槽。\n可以刪除無效的槽，和/或消費其他槽尚未處理的 WAL，\n然後重新開始升級。\n有問題的槽列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:2570
#, c-format
msgid "Checking subscription state"
msgstr "正在檢查訂閱狀態"

#: check.c:2652
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains subscriptions without origin or having relations not in i (initialize) or r (ready) state.\n"
"You can allow the initial sync to finish for all relations and then restart the upgrade.\n"
"A list of the problematic subscriptions is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含沒有複寫來源的訂閱，或關聯狀態不為 i (初始化) 或 r (就緒) 的訂閱。\n可以讓所有關聯完成初始同步，然後重新開始升級。\n有問題的訂閱列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:2678
#, c-format
msgid "Checking names of databases, roles, and tablespaces"
msgstr "正在檢查資料庫、角色和表空間的名稱"

#: check.c:2721
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your installation contains databases, roles, or tablespaces with names\n"
"with invalid characters (newline or carriage return).  To fix this,\n"
"rename these objects.\n"
"A list of all objects with invalid names is in the file:\n"
"    %s"
msgstr "您的安裝包含名稱中帶有無效字元 (換行或歸位字元)\n的資料庫、角色或表空間。要修復此問題，\n請重新命名這些物件。\n所有名稱無效的物件列在以下檔案中:\n    %s"

#: check.c:2761
#, c-format
msgid "Checking oldestXID and oldestMultiXid consistency"
msgstr "正在檢查 oldestXID 和 oldestMultiXid 的一致性"

#: check.c:2782
#, c-format
msgid "oldestXID (%u) in the control file is newer than the datfrozenxid (%u) of database \"%s\""
